      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ECHOES OF DAD (5) finished fourth last time but just a few runs back pushed the clock when winning over 531m at Gawler, taking a Grade 5 in a fast 30.82. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. MAISIE MOO MOO (7) has been thereabouts without winning, the latest finishing fourth (31.11) off a wide draw at this track in a Grade 5. Solid record at the distance winning 10 races. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can figure in the finish. TAKE THE STEPS (2) stuck on well last time to finish half a length back in second (19.77) at Murray Bridge Straight in a Grade 4/5 over 350m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Overdue and is among the main hopes. WEST ON BURNIE (1) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
